<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>用药安全 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%94%A8%E8%8D%AF%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/</link><description>Recent content in 用药安全 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E7%94%A8%E8%8D%AF%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>药房买药：取处方药、选非处方药、问同服与剂量</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/pharmacy/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:41:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/health/pharmacy/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在美国，&lt;strong&gt;看病和拿药是两件分开的事&lt;/strong&gt;。医生看完病不会给你药，他把处方电子发到药房（&lt;code&gt;I'm sending it to the pharmacy&lt;/code&gt;），然后你自己去取。所以「看完医生就没事了」是错的——&lt;strong&gt;药还在药房等着你，而且可能要等半小时到一小时&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>